    "3": {
      "uid": 3,
      "key": [
        "first Knight of Boreas",
        "Knight of Boreas"
      ],
      "keysecondary": [
        "Jean",
        "Ravenwood",
        "Varka"
      ],
      "comment": "Wandering Knight: First Knight of Boreas",
      "content": "Jean explains that the first wandering knight to claim the title arrived with his wolf, left no succession plan and lost his name. Ravenwood, an informal disciple, then earned the Wolf Spirit's recognition and defended Mondstadt against the returning aristocracy; after that the title was passed within the Knights of Favonius. The lineage nearly died out twice, the second time through Roland.",
