        "Ley Lines"
      ],
      "comment": "Wandering Knight: The Wandering Knight's echo",
      "content": "In Triumphant Warrior and Lonely Warrior Varka hears the knight as a voice from a thousand years ago: first asking Varka to guide him around Mondstadt, then, as a Longing in the Wolf's Gravestone, telling him 'This is not where your path ends. You must continue on.'",
